  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Preventing ice dams on a Utah roof requires stopping attic heat loss and ensuring proper eave ventilation.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "stopping attic heat loss and ensuring proper eave ventilation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Long-Term Prevention"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Improve insulation: Add attic insulation (aim for R-49 or higher, roughly 16 to 18 inches) to keep warm air from escaping through the roof deck and melting snow."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Seal air leaks: Block bypasses around plumbing stacks, attic hatches, and light fixtures to stop warm air from entering the attic."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Ensure ventilation: Keep intake and exhaust vents clear so cold outside air circulates freely through the attic, keeping the roof deck cold."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Install edge systems: Use specialized thermal edge profiles like or self-regulating heat cables along eaves and gutters to maintain drainage channels.",
            "snippet_links": [
              {
                "link": "https://hotedge.com/ice-dam-prevention-in-utah/"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Temporary Maintenance"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Use a roof rake: Clear heavy snow buildup safely from the ground after major Utah snowstorms, working from the edge inward."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Melt channels safely: Fill a nylon stocking with calcium chloride pellets and place it vertically across the ice dam to create a drainage path if a dam forms; avoid standard rock salt, which ruins shingles."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, let me know:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "The current pitch and type of your roof"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Whether you have an accessible attic to check insulation levels"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
